  "description": "CR 115.1, 601.2c, 613.1d, 613.4b, 205.1b: Relive the Past returns up to one target artifact card, land card and non-Aura enchantment card from its caster's graveyard to the battlefield as 5/5 Elemental creatures in addition to their other types",
